      "kind": "lede",
      "html": "<p>A store safety walk is simple but hard. Customers are everywhere. You must spot the missing wet-floor sign, the blocked fire exit and the frayed lead. The employer must protect staff and the public, so far as is reasonably practicable.</p>"
