      "html": "<ul><li>Shop safety falls under the Health and Safety at Work etc Act 1974.</li><li>Slips and trips are the most common cause of major injury in retail.</li><li>Fire exits fall under the Fire Safety Order 2005. Some injuries must be reported under RIDDOR 2013.</li><li>Many managers write it up later from memory. The record suffers.</li><li>The checklist does not make the store safe. Fixing faults does.</li></ul>"
